{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": " Feeling Anxious", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Using Homonyms and Homophones", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Homonyms are made up of homophones and homographs.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"strong\">homophone </span>is a word that has the same sound as another word but has a different meaning and may have a different spelling.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">right </span>and <span class=\"italic\">write </span><br/><span class=\"italic\">right </span>(noun) and <span class=\"italic\">right </span>(adjective)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"strong\">homograph </span>is a word that has the same spelling as another word but has a different sound and a different meaning.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">present </span>(noun) and <span class=\"italic\">present </span>(verb) <br/><span class=\"italic\">wind </span>(noun) and <span class=\"italic\">wind </span>(verb)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "blue ... blew", "type": "example"}, {"content": "complement ... compliment", "type": "example"}, {"content": "pail ... pale", "type": "example"}, {"content": "won ... one", "type": "example"}, {"content": "know ... no", "type": "example"}, {"content": "pre<span class=\"strong\">sent</span> ... <span class=\"strong\">pre</span>sent", "type": "example"}, {"content": "excuse (s) ... excuse (z)", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Stressing <span class=\"italic\">You</span> and <span class=\"italic\">I</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You stress <span class=\"italic\">you</span> and <span class=\"italic\">I</span> to add meaning and emphasis to a statement.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you stress a word, you make it longer, louder and a little higher tone. You can put stress on a word to emphasize it and make your meaning clearer. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You stress <span class=\"italic\">you</span> or <span class=\"italic\">I</span> when you want to emphasize something about a person that is not expected.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I thought <span class=\"strong\">you</span> were going to find out.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you put stress on <span class=\"italic\">you</span>, you shift the emphasis to the other person.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read these sentences with stress on the bolded words.<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li><span class=\"strong\">I</span> was supposed to pay the bill while <span class=\"strong\">you</span> checked.</li><li><span class=\"strong\">You</span> might not care to go snorkeling but <span class=\"strong\">I</span> do.</li><li>No. <span class=\"strong\">I</span> definitely want to go snorkeling.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to complement", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to add to something in a way that improves it or makes it more attractive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The blue complements your eyes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about personal qualities and behavior.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "compliment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a remark that expresses praise or admiration of somebody", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thanks for the compliment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tanned", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having darker skin than before because of spending time in the sun", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Blue also suits you especially when you are tanned.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ability to use words in a clever way to make people laugh", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My dance partner won me over with his wit and style.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having skin that is whiter than usual because of illness, a strong emotion, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hey Sally, you look really pale. Are you okay?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04aud05 ", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pail", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bucket", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Get me that pail over there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of a disagreement you might have with a friend or family member.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue between two people disagreeing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make sure you stress I and you in the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include some homophones where possible.(e.g. pail and pale)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud with stress on I and you.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I put stress on I and you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I include homophones in the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud to practice stressing I and you.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le14ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le14ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob04re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Look how blue the sky is.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Last night's wind blew away the clouds. I think I spent too much time on the beach this morning.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Which one should I wear?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The blue complements your eyes.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks for the compliment. Blue also suits you especially when you are tanned.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks. I think I got burned. Look, I got this one on sale!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's gorgeous. What time do we set sail?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I thought you were going to find out.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I thought <span class=\"italic\">you</span> were going to.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: <span class=\"italic\">I</span> was supposed to pay the bill while <span class=\"italic\">you</span> checked.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I didn't know where to get the info. There was no sign anywhere, and then I started dancing and forgot.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think the next one leaves around one. We'll take that. Sound good?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My dance partner won me over with his wit and style.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You aren't even listening. <span class=\"italic\">You</span> might not care to go snorkeling but <span class=\"italic\">I</span> do.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No. <span class=\"italic\">I</span> definitely want to go snorkeling. Hey Sally, you look really pale. Are you okay?", "id": 2, "time": "35500"}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Get me that pail over there. I think I'm going to be sick.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What happened?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sunstroke. Looks like you'll have to go without me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't just leave you here.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Please go.", "id": 3, "time": "70000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about emotions, personal qualities and behavior.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can say and use words like fast and bear.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can stress <span class=\"italic\">I</span> and <span class=\"italic\">you</span>.", "type"